The coolest thing just happened. I was playing a Barbarian(and still am)
and am on the first level. I go into a room with an altar, so after
I kill a jackal and have a snack, I have in my possesion a partially-
eaten jackal corpse. So I decide "Let's offer it to the gods." Why not?

So I do and he/she/it enjoys it too and leaves an object at my feet.
I pick up the object to discover it is a broadsword called Stormbringer(!).

So then I pray at the altar in thanks. He is pleased. I now have
a BLESSED broadsword named Stormbringer(!!!).
This game just keeps on getting better and better.  All for
a few jackal innards.

